fonts-patrone-sans (2.0.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Patrone Sans 2.000, a typeface of PatroneOS's own, drawn from scratch
    (with AI help) in place of Patrone Sans 1, which was Noto Sans with a
    tailed l and a slashed zero. Nothing of Noto Sans is left in it. Six
    weights in one variable font (Light, Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Bold,
    Black), a plain zero told from O by its narrow oval, a tailed l and a
    1 with a foot, and Patrone Sans 1's line spacing. Latin only: Greek
    and Cyrillic come from Noto Sans, after it. No italic. Under the OFL
    1.1, with only PatroneOS's copyright.

 -- William Daugherty <31995458+billsecond@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:00:00 -0500

